      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Rupture of an anomalous tendon slip between the FDS aponeurosis and FDP tendon to the ring finger was found in a young woman's forearm upon surgical exploration after months of forearm pain and disability. Excision of the anomalous slip resulted in quick and and complete recovery."},
